================================================================================
Reporting a licensing problem
================================================================================

Open an issue at https://github.com/dasomel/narwhal/issues. A wrong SPDX id in
the component map is a defect: it is repeated downstream in every SBOM the
bundle produces, so it is worth reporting even when it looks pedantic.
